{
  "_doc": "Every way a wolf's disguise can slip. subtlety 1 = obvious, 5 = very hard. 'tells' is merged into the wolf's look; see js/art/sheep.js for what each key draws. Tells sharing a 'group' are variants of one idea: the generator picks a group first, then a variant, so variants don't crowd out other tells. 'notWith' lists traits of the wolf's costume that would hide the tell ('horns' = any value, 'wool:ash' = that value). Colour tells set 'tint' to a target perceptual difference, ΔE (bigger = more obvious) and are rejected if the shifted fleece lands near another breed in the flock. 'colorOnly' tells are skipped when the player turns on colour-friendly tells. 'kind' is the wolf part the tell belongs to, counted for the tell achievements (data/achievements.json → tellKinds).",
